      "content": "Terrain is the primary REST API gateway for CyVerse's Discovery Environment (DE), an open-source data science workbench for life sciences. Terrain validates user authentication via Keycloak JWT tokens and orchestrates calls to backend microservices covering filesystem operations, application management, data analysis, metadata annotation, notifications, and persistent identifier management.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: CyVerse Support",
